  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Visakhapatnam-Chennai Industrial Corridor Development Program (Tranche 2)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project is the second tranche of the multitranche financing facility (MFF) for Visakhapatnam-Chennai Industrial Corridor Development Program (VCICDP). With the comprehensive support through upstream strategic studies and regular programmatic interventions, tranche 2 will unlock the state&apos;s manufacturing potential through fostering industrial agglomeration with holistic infrastructure support, investment promotion, and skills development. The project will also strengthen climate and disaster resilience and integrate industrial and urban planning for more competitive and livable cities.</narrative>
  </description>
